@flexiarg musn/fulab-report-block
@title FULAB Report Block
@sigils [➰/卡]
@audience fulab agents, musn server
@tone technical
@style pattern
@why no problem-corpus source matched (@holds-at absent; holds-token and id-text searches over every node in [problems] found no match). Negative claim per the committed check futon2 holes labs library-loop runs l6_no_source_check.py, receipt runs/L10-no-source-check.edn. Rationale not invented (L10 rationale-backfill, zai-1, 2026-09-05)
@how own mechanism: End the response with a FULAB-REPORT block listing applied patterns. (source: this pattern's ! conclusion line; L10 rationale-backfill, zai-1, 2026-09-05)

! conclusion: End the response with a FULAB-REPORT block listing applied patterns.

  + context: MUSN parses the report block to record pattern use evidence.

  + IF:
    The response omits the report block or leaves it empty.

  + HOWEVER:
    The agent should stay concise at the end of a turn.

  + THEN:
    Emit a FULAB-REPORT block with :applied, :action, and :notes fields.

  + BECAUSE:
    Explicit report blocks anchor pattern use records in the log.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    - evidence: agent response contains [FULAB-REPORT] with fields.
    - evidence-shape: {:applied :string, :action :string, :notes :string}
